        "node_id": "n_5_1aa172",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2 (corrected): Initialize a list instead of a set to store the extracted words, as lists support the `append()` method required for dynamically adding words during the row and column scans. After collecting all valid words, convert the list to a sorted sequence or use the `min()` function to identify the lexicographically smallest word.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-4284364204132802724",
