        "node_id": "n_7_aecf79",
        "thought_text": "Iterate through every cell in the grid. For each cell, attempt to build horizontal and vertical words by expanding in both directions until hitting a block or grid boundary. Collect all valid words with length >= 2 and track the lexicographically smallest one.",
